    <data key="d0">Credimi Electronic Invoice Processing Architecture</data>
    <data key="d1">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=O5Sn5QCEAzE</data>
    <data key="d2">Credimi processes electronic invoices using Kubernetes microservices on EC2, Amazon S3 for invoice document storage, AWS Lambda for async XML parsing, and Amazon RDS MySQL in Multi-AZ for metadata storage.</data>
    <data key="d3">Fintech, Serverless, Microservices</data>
    <data key="d4">True</data>
